		(at 125.35 74.91 90)
		(descr "Silvertel Ag59800-LPB series (Ag59812-LPB, Ag59824-LPB) IEEE 802.3bt Type 4 Class 8 PoE PD module, SMT, 50.6x30 mm. Land pattern from datasheet V2.0 figure 17. The isolation keep-out covers both the tabulated and the drawn stripe, on all copper layers; continue it across the host board. Datasheet p19: solder-mask-defined pads preferred, minimal thermal relief, never reflow the module hanging upside down (on the bottom side: solder it last or by hand) (https://silvertel.com/images/datasheets/Ag59800-LPB%20-datasheet-high%20efficiency%20SMT%20IEEE802_3BT%20100W%20power-over-ethernet%20module.pdf)")
